delete.description:
Removes an entry that the panel installed, as the system task. An entry
installed by the system, or needed by web domains, answers `403`;
another running system task answers `409 E_INUSE` with `existing`.

put.description:
Rewrites the pool of every web domain on the profile and reloads PHP-FPM;
when a version does not run afterwards, the previous profile comes back
(`500 E_RESTART`).

post.description:
Updates `package`, or every package without it, as the system task;
the panel may restart while it runs. Another running system task
answers `409 E_INUSE` with `existing`.
